<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN BRANTANO PLANS JUNE BOURSE LISTING.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN BRANTANO PLANS JUNE BOURSE LISTING.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Brantano, a network of shoe shops, said on Monday it was planning a bourse listing in June.</p>
<p>&quot;Brantano NV is planning a public offering on the Brussels stock market in June this year,&quot; it said in a statement.  </p>
<p>Brantano said it would announced details of the listing at a news conference on May 14.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
